{"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/stronglyConnectedComponents()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The strongly connected components: maximal sets of vertices each reaching every other."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Tarjan’s algorithm, iterative, O(V + E)."}],"metadata":{"title":"stronglyConnectedComponents()","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P12ConnectivityE27stronglyConnectedComponentsAD0G0VyxGyF","modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"Connectivity"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"stronglyConnectedComponents"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Components","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Connectivity\/StronglyConnectedComponents.swift#L131","fileName":"StronglyConnectedComponents.swift"},"symbolKind":"method","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"stronglyConnectedComponents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Components","identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/Components","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV"